Changes in this fork:
- Clearcut telemetry never starts and never POSTs.
- Suite archives, public eval builds, and the dashboard read and write local
  directories only. Google Cloud Storage, gcloud tokens, and the storage proxy
  are removed.
- npm publish, GitHub Pages deployment, Gemini release-note and embedding
  uploads, and the nightly summary email are removed.
- A stored Google access token is ignored. Sign-in controls stay hidden.

